1
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:06,316
(Final Episode)

2
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,279
- Ji Hwan.
- Excuse me.

3
00:00:09,279 --> 00:00:11,814
Yoon Jun Seo, what a surprise.

4
00:00:11,814 --> 00:00:13,359
I didn't expect you to come.

5
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:15,110
Of course, I should come.

6
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,598
Where is Manager Kim?

7
00:00:16,598 --> 00:00:18,006
Manager Kim?

8
00:00:18,006 --> 00:00:20,272
Why do you think she would...

9
00:00:20,272 --> 00:00:22,636
Ji Hwan, do you want something to drink?

10
00:00:23,824 --> 00:00:24,996
She came.

11
00:00:24,996 --> 00:00:27,496
Actually, she came yesterday as well.

12
00:00:28,548 --> 00:00:29,800
Jun Seo, there you are.

13
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,855
Over there.

14
00:00:58,466 --> 00:00:59,702
It's warm.

15
00:01:01,761 --> 00:01:03,829
I heard you're going to study abroad.

16
00:01:06,346 --> 00:01:07,846
Where did you hear that from?

17
00:01:08,691 --> 00:01:10,765
I wanted to tell you myself.

18
00:01:13,874 --> 00:01:16,077
I wanted to meet you before you leave.

19
00:01:17,418 --> 00:01:18,558
So, I came here.

20
00:01:19,531 --> 00:01:20,701
How are you holding up?

21
00:01:22,957 --> 00:01:26,204
People say things are also hard
for the caregiver.

22
00:01:28,859 --> 00:01:29,901
It's hard.

23
00:01:33,098 --> 00:01:34,646
It's very tough.

24
00:01:37,971 --> 00:01:39,704
I'm silly.

25
00:01:40,810 --> 00:01:44,634
When you say it's hard,
I just want to help you out,

26
00:01:44,634 --> 00:01:46,333
without a valid reason.

27
00:01:48,003 --> 00:01:49,902
How have I become like this?

28
00:02:01,212 --> 00:02:02,856
We should say our goodbyes here.

29
00:02:19,125 --> 00:02:20,880
Let's forget everything that had happened.

30
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:26,144
I'll forget everything, and so will you.

31
00:02:27,406 --> 00:02:28,521
Will you?

32
00:02:33,622 --> 00:02:34,849
Bye.

33
00:02:46,349 --> 00:02:47,504
Jun Seo.

34
00:03:00,204 --> 00:03:01,976
I changed my mind.

35
00:03:04,365 --> 00:03:06,048
I'll still forget everything,

36
00:03:07,235 --> 00:03:12,303
but will you remember me?

37
00:03:14,356 --> 00:03:18,304
Please think of me once in a while.

38
00:03:22,605 --> 00:03:27,007
Remember how much I loved you
from all my heart.

39
00:03:28,813 --> 00:03:34,376
If you don't, my love would be so pitiful.

40
00:03:37,051 --> 00:03:38,306
Will you?

41
00:03:40,170 --> 00:03:41,227
Of course...

42
00:03:43,242 --> 00:03:44,242
I will.

43
00:03:48,234 --> 00:03:49,604
I won't forget it.

44
00:03:54,218 --> 00:03:55,218
All right.

45
00:03:55,867 --> 00:03:57,044
Let me see.

46
00:04:02,034 --> 00:04:04,008
It's fine.

47
00:04:04,008 --> 00:04:05,676
I must've been hit somewhere.

48
00:04:07,633 --> 00:04:11,170
Why did he go to Seoul,
leaving you alone like this?

49
00:04:12,929 --> 00:04:16,570
He went to visit Ji Hwan's exhibition,

50
00:04:16,570 --> 00:04:18,332
and he said he needed to meet someone.

51
00:04:21,370 --> 00:04:22,787
It's important to him.

52
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:32,068
I told you not to disturb me.

53
00:04:35,513 --> 00:04:39,300
Does it hurt a lot? Does it?

54
00:04:41,209 --> 00:04:42,277
No.

55
00:04:43,602 --> 00:04:45,380
No, only sometimes.

56
00:04:47,154 --> 00:04:48,925
Do you want me to rub you?

57
00:04:54,778 --> 00:04:59,286
Mommy's hand is a cure-all

58
00:05:00,058 --> 00:05:04,220
My baby isn't sick anymore

59
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:09,620
Mommy's hand is a cure-all

60
00:05:11,746 --> 00:05:12,875
Do you like it?

61
00:05:14,082 --> 00:05:15,364
I love it.

62
00:05:18,194 --> 00:05:21,833
It's the first time
you've done it to me, isn't it?

63
00:05:25,230 --> 00:05:26,230
It is.

64
00:05:29,366 --> 00:05:34,656
Mommy's hand is a cure-all

65
00:05:35,734 --> 00:05:41,153
My baby isn't sick anymore

66
00:05:42,598 --> 00:05:46,860
Mommy's hand is a cure-all

67
00:05:59,660 --> 00:06:02,574
Nothing much has changed

68
00:06:02,574 --> 00:06:04,258
I will see you next week.

69
00:06:05,381 --> 00:06:06,879
Thank you.

70
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:08,007
How...

71
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:14,248
How can I notice if I get worse?

72
00:06:15,532 --> 00:06:19,374
How can I know if I'm getting worse?

73
00:06:22,316 --> 00:06:23,427
How can I know?

74
00:06:23,427 --> 00:06:26,775
There are various signs and symptoms.

75
00:06:27,597 --> 00:06:30,502
Have you had hemoptysis yet?

76
00:06:30,916 --> 00:06:32,183
Hemoptysis?

77
00:06:32,885 --> 00:06:37,126
Do you mean "cough up blood?"

78
00:07:00,066 --> 00:07:03,732
Could you take pictures of me?

79
00:07:05,516 --> 00:07:06,929
Take pictures?

80
00:07:06,929 --> 00:07:07,929
Yes.

81
00:07:10,385 --> 00:07:11,634
Let's take pictures.

82
00:07:14,441 --> 00:07:17,850
I want to take pictures
while I still look fine.

83
00:07:19,716 --> 00:07:20,716
Will you?

84
00:07:25,643 --> 00:07:27,030
Will you take pictures?

85
00:07:29,052 --> 00:07:30,127
No.

86
00:07:30,884 --> 00:07:32,558
Because other people can see
your pictures, too.

87
00:07:38,555 --> 00:07:40,966
I want to remember this later.

88
00:07:42,121 --> 00:07:43,539
When I get better,

89
00:07:44,762 --> 00:07:49,353
I would say I used to be sick like this.

90
00:07:49,353 --> 00:07:50,542
I'll remember that.

91
00:07:54,362 --> 00:07:55,947
Can you take pictures?

92
00:10:59,663 --> 00:11:02,008
You are so bad at making porridge.

93
00:11:02,862 --> 00:11:05,137
It's surprisingly bland and tasteless.

94
00:11:08,485 --> 00:11:11,877
You can't have anything salty,
so just eat up.

95
00:11:13,659 --> 00:11:15,197
Does yours taste better?

96
00:11:16,817 --> 00:11:17,817
Of course.

97
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:30,035
Why are you eating this?

98
00:11:31,025 --> 00:11:33,123
Why are you eating the same thing as mine?

99
00:11:36,609 --> 00:11:39,327
How about I cook something good for you?

100
00:11:40,914 --> 00:11:42,478
No. That's fine.

101
00:11:42,478 --> 00:11:44,673
I don't want to eat anything else.

102
00:11:46,452 --> 00:11:47,577
Let's just eat this.

103
00:11:56,990 --> 00:11:59,049
It's not tasty at all.

104
00:13:03,166 --> 00:13:04,297
Tae Seok.

105
00:13:09,096 --> 00:13:10,280
Have you eaten well?

106
00:13:12,374 --> 00:13:14,184
Have you seen the doctor regularly?

107
00:13:16,718 --> 00:13:18,688
Did you miss me?

108
00:13:22,285 --> 00:13:24,922
You always smile when I want your answer.

109
00:13:27,270 --> 00:13:28,551
I've missed you.

110
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:31,713
You should've come more often to see me.

111
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:34,716
I'm a very busy man.

112
00:13:34,716 --> 00:13:37,737
Why should I come here, anyway?
To check if you're happy with Jun Seo?

113
00:13:37,737 --> 00:13:38,749
No.

114
00:13:41,994 --> 00:13:43,141
Do you like roses?

115
00:13:45,691 --> 00:13:47,520
Thanks.

116
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:48,629
That's so beautiful.

117
00:13:51,715 --> 00:13:53,004
You're more beautiful.

118
00:13:55,484 --> 00:13:59,349
No way, I look worse and worse.

119
00:13:59,802 --> 00:14:02,171
Yes, you had better do that.

120
00:14:02,171 --> 00:14:04,341
Then you will look ugly even to my eyes.

121
00:14:11,067 --> 00:14:14,179
What should I do
if even you come to dislike me?

122
00:14:14,179 --> 00:14:16,936
What's the matter? You have Jun Seo.

123
00:14:17,917 --> 00:14:20,297
He seems not to like me these days.

124
00:14:30,995 --> 00:14:32,146
Look at him.

125
00:14:33,116 --> 00:14:34,116
I see.

126
00:14:35,324 --> 00:14:37,777
Jun Seo, it's been a while.

127
00:14:37,777 --> 00:14:39,213
Right. There you are.

128
00:14:46,018 --> 00:14:49,937
I was coughing on the bus the other day,

129
00:14:49,937 --> 00:14:52,281
and a boy in front of me looked at me.

130
00:14:52,281 --> 00:14:56,191
Then he mimicked me coughing.

131
00:14:57,166 --> 00:14:58,166
Did he?

132
00:14:58,941 --> 00:15:02,190
I kept coughing, but it was so funny.

133
00:15:03,181 --> 00:15:04,264
Isn't that funny?

134
00:15:08,205 --> 00:15:11,031
Yes, it is.

135
00:15:12,814 --> 00:15:15,354
Tae Seok.

136
00:15:15,354 --> 00:15:18,261
Why don't we take pictures
since you're here?

137
00:15:18,261 --> 00:15:19,264
Take pictures?

138
00:15:20,037 --> 00:15:22,503
I have taken a lot of pictures.

139
00:15:23,318 --> 00:15:25,889
Have you?

140
00:15:28,776 --> 00:15:32,765
Can you bring me a camera?

141
00:15:32,765 --> 00:15:35,311
Let's take pictures.

142
00:15:36,549 --> 00:15:40,544
I want to take pictures with Tae Seok.

143
00:15:44,893 --> 00:15:46,857
All right.

144
00:15:46,857 --> 00:15:48,487
Okay.

145
00:15:48,487 --> 00:15:50,108
I'll bring it, then.

146
00:15:51,208 --> 00:15:53,596
You didn't even laugh
when I told you a funny story.

147
00:15:54,576 --> 00:15:55,953
I'll bring it.

148
00:15:55,953 --> 00:15:57,875
- No.
- I'll bring it.

149
00:16:02,994 --> 00:16:04,562
Do you think that was funny?

150
00:16:06,634 --> 00:16:08,627
Was it funny you were coughing
because you're sick?

151
00:16:10,296 --> 00:16:12,931
Do you think it's fun to talk
as if you're dying?

152
00:16:12,931 --> 00:16:14,004
Jun Seo.

153
00:16:14,370 --> 00:16:15,668
Do you think I'm funny, too?

154
00:16:18,586 --> 00:16:19,993
Is it also funny...

155
00:16:21,703 --> 00:16:24,209
to see how I'm concerned about
whether you're sick or in pain?

156
00:16:29,894 --> 00:16:35,626
Eun Seo, this morning, did you...

157
00:16:41,844 --> 00:16:43,063
I'm sorry, Tae Seok.

158
00:16:56,437 --> 00:16:59,959
He really hates me, doesn't he?

159
00:17:02,717 --> 00:17:03,839
You're right.

160
00:17:22,879 --> 00:17:24,178
Save her.

161
00:17:26,361 --> 00:17:27,938
Please save her.

162
00:17:31,624 --> 00:17:32,812
Save her, please.

163
00:17:37,161 --> 00:17:41,779
Save Eun Seo, please.

164
00:17:46,199 --> 00:17:48,179
They love each other so much,

165
00:17:52,937 --> 00:17:54,841
so I let her be with him.

166
00:18:00,633 --> 00:18:01,903
Please don't take her away.

167
00:18:08,561 --> 00:18:10,058
Please save her.

168
00:18:54,519 --> 00:18:55,519
Right.

169
00:18:59,368 --> 00:19:00,761
It came out well.

170
00:19:03,432 --> 00:19:07,162
I'm very sick, aren't I?

171
00:19:10,097 --> 00:19:13,162
I got much worse, didn't I?

172
00:19:19,097 --> 00:19:25,115
Why don't we have dinner...

173
00:19:26,025 --> 00:19:30,108
with Mom, Dad, and everyone some time?

174
00:19:37,687 --> 00:19:42,971
Please keep these photos with you.

175
00:19:46,144 --> 00:19:49,315
Whether I'm pretty or not,

176
00:19:51,039 --> 00:19:55,459
I believe you'll keep them.

177
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:00,580
You should keep them...

178
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:07,914
since I might be gone soon.

179
00:20:09,928 --> 00:20:10,979
Eun Seo.

180
00:20:19,816 --> 00:20:20,934
I'm just saying...

181
00:20:22,818 --> 00:20:24,875
I might be gone.

182
00:20:27,242 --> 00:20:28,965
I don't mean I will be gone.

183
00:20:38,442 --> 00:20:40,211
Don't hate me.

184
00:20:42,818 --> 00:20:46,772
I feel so bad for you because I'm sick.

185
00:20:48,564 --> 00:20:50,925
But what can I do if you hate me?

186
00:20:54,434 --> 00:20:56,387
When you like me,

187
00:20:57,978 --> 00:21:03,372
there is nothing I want anymore. Right?

188
00:21:11,811 --> 00:21:13,005
I like you.

189
00:21:16,258 --> 00:21:17,694
All I have is you.

190
00:21:19,810 --> 00:21:21,232
My life is...

191
00:21:24,373 --> 00:21:26,639
all about you from the beginning
to the end,

192
00:21:32,144 --> 00:21:34,239
I'm like this because I love you so much.

193
00:21:40,326 --> 00:21:42,816
So, I won't let you go.

194
00:21:58,194 --> 00:21:59,503
Don't worry.

195
00:22:01,970 --> 00:22:07,955
I won't let you go alone.

196
00:23:22,374 --> 00:23:24,274
Soon Im,
why are you drinking in broad daylight?

197
00:23:25,726 --> 00:23:26,869
You.

198
00:23:27,530 --> 00:23:30,884
It's none of your business if I drink.

199
00:23:32,929 --> 00:23:34,837
Why do you care?

200
00:23:36,418 --> 00:23:39,591
My unfortunate fate ruined
even my daughter's life.

201
00:23:40,602 --> 00:23:42,332
Why do you care?

202
00:23:55,682 --> 00:23:57,444
What are you doing here?

203
00:23:58,198 --> 00:24:00,548
Give me a drink, too.

204
00:24:02,602 --> 00:24:04,214
Did you go to Eun Seo?

205
00:24:04,929 --> 00:24:06,725
I don't think you did.

206
00:24:07,265 --> 00:24:09,191
How dare I go there?

207
00:24:11,185 --> 00:24:13,309
I think Professor Yoon was coming, too.

208
00:24:14,576 --> 00:24:17,863
I thought so. That's why I'm here.

209
00:24:20,316 --> 00:24:21,791
I thought you would probably be sad.

210
00:24:23,113 --> 00:24:24,628
I don't need anything.

211
00:24:25,994 --> 00:24:27,725
I need nothing at all.

212
00:24:28,450 --> 00:24:29,990
I don't need anything at all.

213
00:24:30,347 --> 00:24:33,952
Mom, you have to be strong.

214
00:24:33,952 --> 00:24:36,508
Don't lose hope, please.

215
00:24:37,892 --> 00:24:38,968
Mom.

216
00:25:08,238 --> 00:25:09,469
Cheers to our dinner.

217
00:25:09,469 --> 00:25:10,712
Cheers.

218
00:25:13,332 --> 00:25:15,573
I'm doing well enough, aren't I?

219
00:25:15,573 --> 00:25:16,573
Yes?

220
00:25:28,245 --> 00:25:29,283
You did a good job.

221
00:25:43,639 --> 00:25:47,395
You were so beautiful that day.

222
00:25:57,031 --> 00:25:59,139
Can I brush your hair?

223
00:26:52,828 --> 00:26:56,447
Goodness, please don't take her away
before me.

224
00:27:00,171 --> 00:27:02,181
You can't take her before me.

225
00:27:06,122 --> 00:27:07,122
Okay.

226
00:27:09,041 --> 00:27:11,221
Okay, I'll beat this, mom.

227
00:27:13,451 --> 00:27:15,204
Mom, don't cry.

228
00:27:29,332 --> 00:27:32,012
Mom, these are...

229
00:27:33,572 --> 00:27:35,165
Jun Seo gave them to me.

230
00:27:36,610 --> 00:27:38,629
He asked me to keep them.

231
00:27:40,939 --> 00:27:43,709
He said he couldn't keep them.

232
00:28:00,711 --> 00:28:03,390
Go inside.
I'll be with you soon after cleaning up.

233
00:28:03,390 --> 00:28:04,512
All right.

234
00:29:22,110 --> 00:29:23,110
Eun Seo.

235
00:29:24,438 --> 00:29:25,711
I can't tear them.

236
00:29:25,711 --> 00:29:28,125
It's not easy, Jun Seo. I can't tear them.

237
00:29:28,125 --> 00:29:30,751
Eun Seo, what are you doing?

238
00:29:30,751 --> 00:29:32,843
You wanted to take these pictures.

239
00:29:32,843 --> 00:29:34,780
I wanted them,
and it's my choice to tear them.

240
00:29:34,780 --> 00:29:36,236
I can tear them if I want to.

241
00:29:36,236 --> 00:29:37,236
Eun Seo.

242
00:29:37,236 --> 00:29:40,364
Don't yell at me. You can't yell at me.

243
00:29:42,858 --> 00:29:44,820
What's the matter with you, Eun Seo?

244
00:29:52,361 --> 00:29:53,720
Are you going to die?

245
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:55,194
Are you really going to die?

246
00:29:56,061 --> 00:29:58,037
If I die, would you follow me?

247
00:29:58,037 --> 00:29:59,791
Are you going to die?

248
00:29:59,791 --> 00:30:01,471
Are you?

249
00:30:01,471 --> 00:30:03,053
Why are you...

250
00:30:03,053 --> 00:30:05,310
Why are you going to die following me?

251
00:30:05,310 --> 00:30:06,473
Why?

252
00:30:11,271 --> 00:30:12,522
Promise me.

253
00:30:14,095 --> 00:30:17,620
Promise me that
you won't think about dying, ever.

254
00:30:19,321 --> 00:30:21,681
Promise me now.

255
00:30:23,839 --> 00:30:24,991
Promise me.

256
00:30:26,373 --> 00:30:27,456
Promise me.

257
00:30:28,131 --> 00:30:29,131
No.

258
00:30:31,313 --> 00:30:32,414
I can't.

259
00:30:34,634 --> 00:30:36,893
You're asking me to live without you.

260
00:30:39,825 --> 00:30:41,064
Promise me.

261
00:30:41,064 --> 00:30:42,064
No.

262
00:30:44,818 --> 00:30:45,866
Eun Seo.

263
00:30:48,830 --> 00:30:53,682
How can I live without you?

264
00:30:55,639 --> 00:30:57,371
How can you be so cruel?

265
00:30:59,983 --> 00:31:02,604
How can I live without you?

266
00:31:02,604 --> 00:31:04,063
How can I live?

267
00:31:05,741 --> 00:31:06,984
I can't live.

268
00:31:09,093 --> 00:31:10,849
I don't want to live with that pain.

269
00:31:16,113 --> 00:31:17,535
Can you do that if you were me?

270
00:31:18,796 --> 00:31:20,143
But, please live.

271
00:31:21,172 --> 00:31:22,977
Please live for me.

272
00:31:24,669 --> 00:31:26,705
I'm dying now.

273
00:31:28,043 --> 00:31:30,877
And you also want to be dying,

274
00:31:30,877 --> 00:31:35,768
so should we spend my final moments
dying in unison?

275
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:39,608
Why are you making me do
such a horrible thing?

276
00:31:41,765 --> 00:31:43,528
You said you love me.

277
00:31:45,069 --> 00:31:47,264
Would you like to make me kill you?

278
00:31:49,493 --> 00:31:50,680
Promise me.

279
00:31:57,070 --> 00:31:58,768
Promise me.

280
00:32:07,589 --> 00:32:08,903
I promise you.

281
00:33:44,758 --> 00:33:45,825
I will take a vow.

282
00:33:48,598 --> 00:33:50,290
I, Yoon Jun Seo,

283
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:56,235
will love and cherish Choi Eun Seo
all the days of my life.

284
00:34:00,450 --> 00:34:02,511
Will you, Choi Eun Seo,

285
00:34:02,511 --> 00:34:05,298
love and cherish Yoon Jun Seo
all the days of your life?

286
00:34:11,263 --> 00:34:12,275
I will.

287
00:34:23,642 --> 00:34:25,469
I absolve you from your sins.

288
00:34:27,849 --> 00:34:29,932
I absolve you from your sins.

289
00:36:09,944 --> 00:36:10,956
Jun Seo.

290
00:36:13,711 --> 00:36:14,762
Jun Seo.

291
00:36:17,456 --> 00:36:18,547
Jun Seo.

292
00:36:23,023 --> 00:36:24,121
Jun Seo.

293
00:36:27,472 --> 00:36:28,506
Eun Seo.

294
00:36:29,455 --> 00:36:34,307
Can you take me to the beach?

295
00:37:06,163 --> 00:37:11,277
When I look back, we were always together.

296
00:37:15,556 --> 00:37:16,556
We were.

297
00:37:19,620 --> 00:37:23,332
Do you have anything you regret, Eun Seo?

298
00:37:32,276 --> 00:37:35,773
No, I don't regret anything.

299
00:37:37,955 --> 00:37:39,654
Because I have you.

300
00:37:44,813 --> 00:37:46,470
All the people who I leave behind.

301
00:37:48,924 --> 00:37:53,647
Dad, Mom,

302
00:37:56,587 --> 00:37:58,798
and Tae Seok.

303
00:38:02,562 --> 00:38:04,278
I don't worry about them.

304
00:38:08,139 --> 00:38:10,418
Because you will take care of them.

305
00:38:12,931 --> 00:38:14,014
Will you?

306
00:38:21,452 --> 00:38:22,452
I will.

307
00:38:24,467 --> 00:38:25,613
I'll take care of them.

308
00:38:28,642 --> 00:38:31,109
So, you have nothing to worry about.

309
00:38:33,986 --> 00:38:35,487
Throughout my life,

310
00:38:38,419 --> 00:38:40,925
without missing a moment,

311
00:38:44,572 --> 00:38:46,441
I have loved you...

312
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:50,931
every moment of my life.
You know that, don't you?

313
00:38:54,656 --> 00:38:55,757
I know.

314
00:39:01,400 --> 00:39:02,890
Because I have loved you, too.

315
00:39:07,609 --> 00:39:08,778
Thank you.

316
00:39:16,496 --> 00:39:17,496
I...

317
00:39:20,130 --> 00:39:21,774
want to take a nap.

318
00:39:25,306 --> 00:39:26,726
Can you give me a piggyback ride?

319
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:40,828
Tell me something, Jun Seo.

320
00:39:42,834 --> 00:39:45,566
I want to fall asleep listening to you.

321
00:39:48,411 --> 00:39:49,686
What are we...

322
00:39:52,675 --> 00:39:53,976
going to do tomorrow?

323
00:39:59,133 --> 00:40:00,133
What?

324
00:40:03,052 --> 00:40:06,698
Well, tomorrow...

325
00:40:09,852 --> 00:40:12,624
I'll think of you as soon as I wake up.

326
00:40:15,251 --> 00:40:16,716
I will think of you...

327
00:40:21,216 --> 00:40:23,059
and sort out your photos.

328
00:40:29,425 --> 00:40:30,523
Are you asleep, Eun Seo?

329
00:40:32,017 --> 00:40:33,027
Yes.

330
00:40:35,481 --> 00:40:36,551
And...

331
00:40:38,691 --> 00:40:44,118
I'll call Mom and Dad
to tell them how you are.

332
00:40:45,028 --> 00:40:46,676
Then we'll have lunch.

333
00:40:49,539 --> 00:40:50,717
And...

334
00:41:21,961 --> 00:41:23,150
Eun Seo.

335
00:41:26,466 --> 00:41:27,557
I love you.

336
00:41:31,707 --> 00:41:32,973
I love you.

337
00:41:37,434 --> 00:41:38,869
I love you so much.

338
00:41:42,130 --> 00:41:43,348
Do you know that, Eun Seo?

339
00:41:52,410 --> 00:41:53,902
Eun Seo, you know that, don't you?

340
00:42:08,315 --> 00:42:10,684
What should we do tomorrow
in the afternoon?

341
00:42:14,268 --> 00:42:16,471
Should we just take a nap
in the afternoon?

342
00:42:16,471 --> 00:42:17,491
Eun Seo.

343
00:42:19,640 --> 00:42:21,207
Eun Seo.

344
00:42:21,207 --> 00:42:22,253
No.

345
00:42:24,039 --> 00:42:25,363
Let's go for a walk.

346
00:42:27,656 --> 00:42:29,769
We'll take a walk...

347
00:42:32,175 --> 00:42:33,459
along the path you like.

348
00:42:36,712 --> 00:42:38,011
Then in the evening,

349
00:42:41,888 --> 00:42:43,332
we will make a fire...

350
00:42:45,665 --> 00:42:47,546
and drink beer.

351
00:42:48,919 --> 00:42:49,919
What do you think?

352
00:42:51,688 --> 00:42:52,819
Eun Seo.

353
00:45:13,235 --> 00:45:14,439
Jun Seo.

354
00:45:15,906 --> 00:45:17,300
Thank you for coming.

355
00:45:20,227 --> 00:45:21,453
Jun Seo.

356
00:45:21,963 --> 00:45:24,856
Tae Seok is here, too.

357
00:45:29,086 --> 00:45:30,566
I'll get him.

358
00:45:33,891 --> 00:45:35,005
Go in.

359
00:45:37,482 --> 00:45:39,588
Go in and say goodbye to Eun Seo.

360
00:46:17,320 --> 00:46:19,219
What is this, Choi Eun Seo?

361
00:46:21,713 --> 00:46:23,932
You didn't keep any promises.

362
00:46:27,303 --> 00:46:28,489
What are you doing?

363
00:46:35,567 --> 00:46:36,706
What have you done?

364
00:46:38,935 --> 00:46:40,831
You couldn't have saved Eun Seo.

365
00:46:43,907 --> 00:46:45,229
What were you doing?

366
00:46:47,412 --> 00:46:48,469
What did you do?

367
00:46:57,987 --> 00:47:00,198
I can't remember Eun Seo's face
since yesterday.

368
00:47:02,571 --> 00:47:03,857
I might have forgotten it.

369
00:47:07,318 --> 00:47:09,159
I can't remember it at all.

370
00:47:14,380 --> 00:47:16,143
How can I live now?

371
00:47:19,385 --> 00:47:21,100
How can I live?

372
00:47:27,456 --> 00:47:29,266
I have nothing left.

373
00:47:32,728 --> 00:47:34,307
What can I hold onto now to live?

374
00:47:38,088 --> 00:47:40,026
I can't even remember her face.

375
00:47:46,240 --> 00:47:47,570
What should I do?

376
00:47:54,759 --> 00:47:55,826
Jun Seo.

377
00:48:00,190 --> 00:48:01,990
How can you live?

378
00:48:05,092 --> 00:48:06,095
How?

379
00:48:09,276 --> 00:48:14,278
I'll keep my promises to Eun Seo.

380
00:48:18,739 --> 00:48:20,046
I will.

381
00:48:25,227 --> 00:48:26,375
Good for you.

382
00:48:29,122 --> 00:48:33,038
That's good for you.

383
00:48:37,244 --> 00:48:39,205
You have promises to keep, at least.

384
00:48:42,251 --> 00:48:43,447
Is that a good thing?

385
00:48:49,123 --> 00:48:51,303
You have no idea...

386
00:48:54,003 --> 00:48:55,671
how harsh that is.

387
00:49:00,132 --> 00:49:03,895
Tae Seok, I have a favor to ask you.

388
00:49:06,323 --> 00:49:07,335
What is it?

389
00:49:13,445 --> 00:49:19,150
Take care of her funeral until the end.

390
00:49:23,605 --> 00:49:26,661
I want to say "farewell" to her
in my own way.

391
00:49:33,925 --> 00:49:35,465
So, you take care of that.

392
00:49:39,836 --> 00:49:41,304
Can you do that?

393
00:49:49,276 --> 00:49:51,432
Eun Seo would like that, too.

394
00:50:42,690 --> 00:50:45,571
Before I keep my promises to you,

395
00:50:45,571 --> 00:50:47,333
I want to be here one more time.

396
00:50:48,620 --> 00:50:50,887
The happiest time,
the most beautiful time.

397
00:50:52,171 --> 00:50:56,150
And this place.
I want to say goodbye to you here.

398
00:51:09,565 --> 00:51:10,568
Then...

399
00:51:12,309 --> 00:51:14,552
I'll live right here where you left...

400
00:51:14,552 --> 00:51:16,994
wondering how long I'll live,

401
00:51:21,376 --> 00:51:25,746
and looking forward to
when you will call for me.

402
00:51:27,089 --> 00:51:28,156
Jun Seo.

403
00:51:28,822 --> 00:51:30,074
Eun Seo.

404
00:51:30,560 --> 00:51:31,627
Jun Seo.

405
00:51:38,545 --> 00:51:39,557
Eun Seo.

406
00:51:41,625 --> 00:51:42,730
Eun Seo.

407
00:54:51,750 --> 00:54:56,085
(Thank you for watching
"Autumn in My Heart.")
